      "created_at": "2025-11-01T12:34:08.721Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I have a peculiar issue which I am not able  to solve. A solution would be welcome.</p>\n<p>I have a chemical for which an Item Master is defined.</p>\n<p>Now the consumption of the acid in manufactory process is in milliliter. And 1 milliliter is 1.71 grams.</p>\n<p>This item is generally purchased in 1 kg bottles.<br>\nHence the Purchase UOM is set a Kg.<br>\nDefault UOM is milliliter.</p>\n<p>Now my problem is in defining the UOM section if item master where all three uom is defined.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/6/c651530b6c6b474ce31488089f0f0027a9edd329.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/c651530b6c6b474ce31488089f0f0027a9edd329\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/6/c651530b6c6b474ce31488089f0f0027a9edd329_2_690x199.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"sioM6oyFpwT3vm1BIQXtPUlBPNn\" width=\"690\" height=\"199\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/6/c651530b6c6b474ce31488089f0f0027a9edd329_2_690x199.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/6/c651530b6c6b474ce31488089f0f0027a9edd329_2_1035x298.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/6/c651530b6c6b474ce31488089f0f0027a9edd329.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FCFCFC\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1095×317 13 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>The first two rows are clear. But what should be the value of the third row for Kg.</p>\n<p>Can someone help with this ?</p>",
